ai "Burner"
about "Pure speed: takes the top off and turns any catch into a race."
position WR
dials vision 0.5 discipline 0.35 patience 0.3 aggression 0.6 risk 0.7

rules:
  when before the throw and route done and qb scrambling -> go deep
  when before the throw and route done and not i am open -> settle in the gap
  when ball thrown to me -> fight for the ball
  when with the ball and open field -> cut upfield
  when with the ball -> run to daylight
  otherwise -> follow assignment
